000100 IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
000200 PROGRAM-ID. KSDSNATU.
000300*    KSDSUPDT, written against native VSAM instead of VSAMIO.
000400*    Reads the KSDS sequentially, rewrites the SAN ANTONIO
000500*    records and deletes the DETROIT ones.
000600 ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
000700 INPUT-OUTPUT SECTION.
000800 FILE-CONTROL.
000900     SELECT KSDS-FILE ASSIGN TO KSDSF01
001000         ORGANIZATION IS INDEXED
001100         ACCESS IS SEQUENTIAL
001200         RECORD KEY IS KR-KEY
001300         FILE STATUS IS WS-STATUS.
001400 DATA DIVISION.
001500 FILE SECTION.
001600 FD  KSDS-FILE
001700     LABEL RECORDS ARE STANDARD
001800     RECORD CONTAINS 80 CHARACTERS.
001900 01  KSDS-RECORD.
002000     02  KR-KEY                  PIC X(10).
002100     02  FILLER                  PIC X(49).
002200     02  KR-CITY                 PIC X(15).
002300     02  FILLER                  PIC X(06).
002400 WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
002500 01  WS-STATUS                   PIC X(2) VALUE '00'.
002600 01  END-OF-FILE-SWITCH          PIC X(1) VALUE 'N'.
002700     88  END-OF-FILE                      VALUE 'Y'.
002800 01  OP-FAILED-SWITCH            PIC X(1) VALUE 'N'.
002900     88  OP-FAILED                        VALUE 'Y'.
003000 PROCEDURE DIVISION.
003100 000-INITIATE.
003200     DISPLAY 'KSDSUPDT: READ/REWRITE KSDS SEQUENTIALLY'.
003300     DISPLAY '----------------------------------------'.
003400     DISPLAY ' '.
003500     OPEN I-O KSDS-FILE.
003600     IF WS-STATUS NOT = '00'
003700         DISPLAY 'VSAM ERROR DURING OPEN, STATUS ' WS-STATUS
003800         MOVE 'Y' TO END-OF-FILE-SWITCH.
003900 010-PROCESS.
004000     PERFORM 110-PROCESS-DATA THRU 119-EXIT UNTIL END-OF-FILE.
004100 020-TERMINATE.
004200     CLOSE KSDS-FILE.
004300     IF WS-STATUS NOT = '00'
004400         DISPLAY 'VSAM ERROR DURING CLOSE, STATUS ' WS-STATUS.
004500     STOP RUN.
004600 110-PROCESS-DATA.
004700     READ KSDS-FILE
004800         AT END MOVE 'Y' TO END-OF-FILE-SWITCH.
004900     IF NOT END-OF-FILE
005000         PERFORM 120-UPDATE-PROCESS THRU 129-EXIT.
005100 119-EXIT.
005200     EXIT.
005300 120-UPDATE-PROCESS.
005400     IF KR-CITY = 'SAN ANTONIO'
005500         PERFORM 130-UPDATE-IT THRU 139-EXIT.
005600     IF KR-CITY = 'DETROIT'
005700         PERFORM 140-DELETE-IT THRU 149-EXIT.
005800 129-EXIT.
005900     EXIT.
006000 130-UPDATE-IT.
006100     DISPLAY KSDS-RECORD.
006200     DISPLAY '           BEFORE UPDATE'.
006300     MOVE 'AUSTIN' TO KR-CITY.
006400     MOVE 'N' TO OP-FAILED-SWITCH.
006500     REWRITE KSDS-RECORD
006600         INVALID KEY MOVE 'Y' TO OP-FAILED-SWITCH.
006700     IF NOT OP-FAILED
006800         DISPLAY KSDS-RECORD
006900         DISPLAY '           AFTER UPDATE'.
007000     IF OP-FAILED
007100         DISPLAY 'VSAM ERROR ON REWRITE, STATUS ' WS-STATUS.
007200 139-EXIT.
007300     EXIT.
007400 140-DELETE-IT.
007500     DISPLAY KSDS-RECORD.
007600     DISPLAY '          BEFORE DELETE'.
007700     MOVE 'N' TO OP-FAILED-SWITCH.
007800     DELETE KSDS-FILE
007900         INVALID KEY MOVE 'Y' TO OP-FAILED-SWITCH.
008000     IF NOT OP-FAILED
008100         DISPLAY '   DELETED  '.
008200     IF OP-FAILED
008300         DISPLAY 'VSAM ERROR ON DELETE, STATUS ' WS-STATUS.
008400 149-EXIT.
008500     EXIT.
